.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH oct-pin-set-reset 1  "oct-pin-set-reset " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
oct\-pin\-set\-reset \- Set Resetting Code
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBoct pin set\-reset\fR [\fB\-P\fR|\fB\-\-admin\-pin\fR] [\fB\-r\fR|\fB\-\-reset\-code\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Set Resetting Code
.PP
Set a Resetting Code by providing the Admin PIN.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-P\fR, \fB\-\-admin\-pin\fR \fI<Admin PIN file>\fR
Optionally, get Admin PIN from a file
.TP
\fB\-r\fR, \fB\-\-reset\-code\fR \fI<Resetting Code file>\fR
Optionally, get the Resetting Code from a file
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
